== Trivia ==
* It costs {{Item|Fishy Treat|amount=1728}} to purchase the {{Item|Frozen Amulet}},  {{Item|Seal Talisman}} and {{Item|Seal Ring}}, {{Item|Seal Pet}}, and all [[Small Seal Plushie|Seal Plushies]].
** This would require a minimum of {{Green|87}} {{Item|Bouncy Beach Ball}}, assuming each {{Item|Bouncy Beach Ball}} bounces {{Green|40}} times.
** To afford {{Green|4}} '''Tidal I''' books, it will take {{Item|Fishy Treat|amount=256}}, which will require a minimum of {{Green|13}}{{Item|Bouncy Beach Ball}}.

